        <p>AGAs are rare here, and they cluster where the kitchen was designed around one: Pasadena and San Marino craftsman remodels, Hancock Park, Brentwood, Pacific Palisades, the hillside houses above Sunset, and out into Montecito-adjacent Ventura County. There is no volume to this brand in Los Angeles — we'd rather tell you that than pretend we run AGA calls daily.</p>
        <p>Call <a href={phoneHref}>{phone}</a> with the <strong>model off the plate</strong> — and if there's a code on a handset or panel, that number too. On this brand the model name settles whether a code even exists: R7 or eR7, Classic or Total Control. That one answer decides what we bring.</p>
